```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Hospital User]) --> B[Submit Emergency Request\nblood group · units · urgency]
    B --> C{Validate Input}
    C -->|Invalid| D[Show Error Message]
    C -->|Valid| E[Create Request Record\nstatus = pending\nreference = BBR-YYYYMMDD-XXXXXX]
    E --> F[Log Audit Event]
    F --> G[Search Matching Inventory\nmatching_service.find_matching_lots]
    G --> H{Candidates Found?}
    H -->|No| I[Show Warning: No Stock\nRequest stays pending]
    H -->|Yes| J[Show Candidate Lots\nBlood Bank · Location · Available · Expiry]
    J --> K{Blood Bank Reserves?}
    K -->|Yes| L[make_reservation\nAtomic Transaction]
    L --> M{Sufficient Stock?}
    M -->|No| N[Raise InsufficientStock Error\nRollback Transaction]
    M -->|Yes| O[Update units_reserved\nCreate Reservation Record\nUpdate Request → matched]
    O --> P[Log Audit Event]
    P --> Q{Physically Delivered?}
    Q -->|No| R[Reservation stays active]
    Q -->|Yes| S[Mark Reservation fulfilled\nUpdate Request → fulfilled]
    K -->|Cancel| T[Hospital Cancels Request]
    T --> U[release_reservations_for_request\nRestore units_reserved\nUpdate Request → cancelled]
    U --> V[Log Audit Event]
```
